title: Proposition 95
---
order: 95
---
short_label: X.95
---
sections:

#### prop_section ####
kind: proposition
----
statement: If an area is contained by a rational straight line and a fifth apotome, then the side of the area is a straight line which produces with a rational area a medial whole.
----
proof:

Let the area {AB} be contained by the rational straight line {AC} and the fifth apotome {AD}.

I say that the side of the area {AB} is a straight line which produces with a rational area a medial whole.

<figure class="diagram">
<canvas id="canvas_0" width="410" height="190" tabindex="0"></canvas>
<noscript><img alt="X.95 diagram" src="propX95.gif"/></noscript>
